result: HIR now carries PackageId identity. hir::Program gained pkg_id:Option<PkgId>
  (root identity) and module_pkgs:HashMap<Symbol,PkgId> (dep module -> PkgId), populated
  in lower_program from the Typer's root_pkg_id/dep_pkg_ids. Program::owner_pkg_id(name)
  recovers per-item package ownership via prefix_module name prefixes, falling back
  to the root — the foundation codegen mangling (2-32-3-11) needs. 3 HIR identity-preservation
  tests added; 307 lib tests pass, zero-warning release build, no new regressions.
description: Propagate PackageId identity into the HIR representation so symbols carry
  their package-scoped identity. Done when HIR nodes reference PackageIds and HIR-level
  tests confirm identity preservation. Depends on resolver threading subtask.
